# Forensic Gadgeteer: "Activated abilities of artifacts you control cost {1} less to activate." Cori-Steel Cutter's equip
# {1}{R} (an artifact other than a Clue) costs {R}: one tapped Mox Ruby pays it, and nothing is left in the pool. Without the
# discount the equip would still be owed a mana and the script would fail waiting for it. The Cutter and the Ornithopter
# are artifact spells cast after the Gadgeteer, so each investigates.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Forensic Gadgeteer
Cori-Steel Cutter
Ornithopter
Mountain
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Forensic Gadgeteer.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Cori-Steel Cutter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Cori-Steel Cutter.Activate(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Cori-Steel Cutter.AttachedTo = Ornithopter
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 1
